	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z2"/>Ornatissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho<note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c"><hi>H:</hi> <persName ref="p495">Henrico</persName>.</note> Bullingero</persName>, ecclesiae <lb xml:id="p1z3"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurensis</placeName> ministro sedulo et diligenti, suo in domino <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>venerabiliter amando.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z5"/>Gratiam et pacem in Christo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Redditae mihi sunt<note xml:id="fnd" type="footnote" n="d"><hi>H:</hi> sunt mihi.</note> literae <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>tuae<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Oben <ref target="file11157">Nr. 1114</ref>.</note>, mi <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, una cum libro tuo De authoritate <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>scripturae et functione episcoporum<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2"><bibl source="b286">HBBibl</bibl> I 111.</note>.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Librum sane nondum perlegi <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>aliis et multis occupatus, nec tamen volui ultra has <placeName ref="l284">Lipsenses</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>nundinas<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Gemeint ist die <placeName ref="l284">Leipziger</placeName> Jubilatemesse; Jubilate fiel 1538 auf den 12. Mai.</note> differre responsum, etiamsi, quod petis, iudicium <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>meum de libro tuo in tanta penuria temporis significare <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>non possim.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Nosti vero alias nobis non displicere stilum <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>et argumentum rerum, in quibus versamini, sed sensu <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>et affectu sumus dissimiles.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Libere enim dicam: <persName ref="p4091">Zwyngli<lb xml:id="p1z14"/>us</persName><note xml:id="fne" type="footnote" n="e"><hi>Tk:</hi> <persName ref="p4091">Zwinglium</persName>.</note> postquam <placeName ref="l311">Marpurgi</placeName> mihi visus et auditus est<note xml:id="fnf" type="footnote" n="f"><hi>H:</hi> visus et auditus mihi est.</note>, virum <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>optimum esse iudicavi sicut et <persName ref="p2442">Oecolampadium</persName>, ita ut eorum <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>casus me pene exanimaverit nulla maiore causa, quam <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>quod credere cogebar alienum esse seu potius permansisse <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>a sententia nostra, quam nos arbitramur veram esse non minus <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>quam vos vestram.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Et id quoque<pb type="edition" next="130"/> dolebat, quod sub nomine tuo <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>postea aedidisti <persName ref="p4091">Zwinglii</persName> librum ad regem christianum <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>scriptum<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4"><persName ref="p1974">Luther</persName> bezieht sich auf <persName ref="p4091">Zwinglis</persName> "Fidei expositio" (<bibl source="b700">Z</bibl> VIA' 1-163), die an König <persName ref="p20225">Franz I.</persName> gerichtet ist. Im Februar 1536 erschien sie erstmals im Druck, versehen mit einer Vorrede <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName>.</note> mira laude celebrans, cum in eo libro esse nosses <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>quam plurima, quae non modo nos, sed omnes pios offendunt <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>optimo iure<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Besonders mißfiel <persName ref="p1974">Luther</persName> <persName ref="p4091">Zwinglis</persName> Lehre von der Seligkeit erwählter Heiden; s. <bibl source="b135">BucerDS</bibl> VI/1 142, 1-7; <bibl source="b40">Vadian BW VII</bibl> 78.</note>.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Non quod invideam honori <persName ref="p4091">Zwinglii</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>de cuius morte tantum<note xml:id="fng" type="footnote" n="g"><hi>H:</hi> tecum.</note> dolorem concepi, sed quod synceritas <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>doctrinae gratia nullius hominis vilipendi debeat.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Haec <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>scribo, ut videas me candore vero sine omni simultate <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>tecum agere.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Vos fortasse creditis nos errare.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Id commendo <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>dei iuditio.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Certe nos etiam non possumus vestra <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>omnia probare, nisi conscientiam vellemus<note xml:id="fnh" type="footnote" n="h"><hi>H:</hi> mallemus.</note> onerare, quod <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>non exigetis a nobis, ut non dubito.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Sed nihil posset <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>mihi ante obitum meum laetius contingere<note xml:id="fni" type="footnote" n="i"><hi>Tk:</hi> Sed nichil posset michi letius ante obitum contingere.</note>, quam si daretur <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>tandem<note xml:id="fnk" type="footnote" n="k"><hi>vor</hi> tandem <hi>ein gestrichenes, unlesbares Wort.</hi></note> per gratiam dei spiritus ille, qui cor et <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>animam unam<note xml:id="fnl" type="footnote" n="l"><hi>H:</hi> meam.</note> in domino recrearet, ut unum saperemus <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>et diceremus in Christo ad gloriam dei patris et salutem <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>animarum.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Haec interim boni consule, donec, si deus <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>volet<note xml:id="fnm" type="footnote" n="m"><hi>H:</hi> velit.</note>, librum<note xml:id="fnn" type="footnote" n="n"><hi>Tk:</hi> libellum; <hi>dazu am Rande nachgetragen:</hi> libellus de autoritate scripture et functione.</note> tuum legero.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Bene vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l558">Wittenbergae</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>14. maii 1538.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z38"/><persName ref="p1974">Martinus Lutherus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
